#ASSERT `s 76(9B)(c) all the directors have made a solvency statement` `a statement signed by every director` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 76(9B)(c) all the directors have made a solvency statement` `a statement for another proposal` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
