#ASSERT `s 76(9B)(d) the company has sent the members the notice in time` (Date 15 10 2026) (Date 19 10 2026) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE (LIST (Date 16 10 2026)) EQUALS JUST TRUE
